### Customs capture against EU acceptance (CDMS-1669)
#
# The fixed sequence that produced the captures in this folder, sent through Trade Gateway's own
# customs endpoints so every request goes out exactly as the gateway builds it. See README.md for
# how to run it through trade-gateway-local-environment.
#
# RULES
# - Send each request once, in order. No retries, no loops, nothing outside this file.
# - Stop at the first unexpected 5xx or auth failure and look before going on.
# - Release (steps 5, 7) CONSUMES quantity on acceptance for good. Keep quantities tiny.
# - After each step, export the raw exchange from the stub's WireMock log, then clear it:
#     curl -s http://localhost:3000/mock/__admin/requests > NN-name.json
#     curl -s -X DELETE http://localhost:3000/mock/__admin/requests

@host = http://localhost:8080
@scope = trade-gateway-resource-srv/access

# As run on 2026-09-29. CHEDP.XI.2026.0000875: validated, one commodity of 1000 kg milk, 600 kg
# already consumed. A rerun needs a CHED with quantity left and MRNs that have not been used.
@chedId = CHEDP.XI.2026.0000875
@line = 1
@classCode = 040100
@unit = KGM
@tiny = 0.001
@larger = 0.002
@mrnA = 26GB1669CAPTUREA01
@mrnB = 26GB1669CAPTUREB01
@mrnC = 26GB1669CAPTUREC01
@mrnD = 26GB1669CAPTURED01
@mrnE = 26GB1669CAPTUREE01
@mrnConsumed = 24GBBGBKCDMS640103

# A validated CHED-A counted in pieces (H87), for steps 28-32.
@chedA = CHEDA.XI.2026.0000159

# In the NEW status, for steps 17-18. Send 18 first to check its line and code match.
@chedNotValidated = CHEDP.XI.2026.0000877

### Token — customs quantity manager
# @name token
POST {{host}}/local/cognito/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

scope={{scope}}&sub=test-customs-quantity-manager

### 01 Baseline ledger
# Answers: is reserved/consumed populated on a "0" read?
GET {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/quantities
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 02 Reserve against MRN-A
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnA}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": {{line}}, "classCode": "{{classCode}}",
  "netWeightQuantity": {{tiny}}, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "{{unit}}" } ] }

### 03 Ledger after reserve
GET {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/quantities
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 04 Reserve MRN-A again with a different quantity
# Answers: does a repeat reservation replace the hold or add to it?
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnA}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": {{line}}, "classCode": "{{classCode}}",
  "netWeightQuantity": {{larger}}, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "{{unit}}" } ] }

### 05 Release MRN-A (consumes quantity)
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnA}}/reservation/release
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 06 Ledger after release
# Answers: does a release show as consumed?
GET {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/quantities
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 07 Release MRN-A again
# Double release.
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnA}}/reservation/release
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 08 Reserve against MRN-B
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnB}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": {{line}}, "classCode": "{{classCode}}",
  "netWeightQuantity": {{tiny}}, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "{{unit}}" } ] }

### 09 Delete MRN-B's reservation
DELETE {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnB}}/reservation
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 10 Ledger after delete
# Answers: does a delete restore the available quantity, and how does it differ from a release?
GET {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/quantities
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 11 Delete MRN-B again
# Delete after delete.
DELETE {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnB}}/reservation
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 12 Release MRN-B
# Releasing a deleted reservation.
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnB}}/reservation/release
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 13 Over-reservation
# Answers: in-band refusal (409) or a fault (502)?
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnB}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": {{line}}, "classCode": "{{classCode}}",
  "netWeightQuantity": 99999999, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "{{unit}}" } ] }

### 14 Wrong commodity code for the line
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnB}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": {{line}}, "classCode": "99999999",
  "netWeightQuantity": {{tiny}}, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "{{unit}}" } ] }

### 15 Unknown certificate line
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnB}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": 999, "classCode": "{{classCode}}",
  "netWeightQuantity": {{tiny}}, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "{{unit}}" } ] }

### 16 Unknown CHED
GET {{host}}/customs/cheds/CHEDP.XI.2026.9999999/quantities
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 17 Reserve against a CHED that is not validated
# Answers: is status checked, and how is it reported (refusal 04 "Inappropriate status" or a fault)?
# Takes nothing if refused, as expected.
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedNotValidated}}/declarations/{{mrnB}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": 1, "classCode": "{{classCode}}",
  "netWeightQuantity": {{tiny}}, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "{{unit}}" } ] }

### 18 Read a CHED that is not validated
# Answers: can a ledger be read whatever the status?
GET {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedNotValidated}}/quantities
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 19 Reserve against the MRN that is already consumed
# Answers: refusal 06 "Write-off for this MRN and PCA document ID exists"? Takes nothing if refused.
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnConsumed}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": {{line}}, "classCode": "{{classCode}}",
  "netWeightQuantity": {{tiny}}, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "{{unit}}" } ] }

### 20 Delete the consumed MRN's reservation
# Answers: outcome 03 "already consumed", or 02? Nothing is reserved, so nothing can change.
DELETE {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnConsumed}}/reservation
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 21 Reserve against MRN-C
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnC}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": {{line}}, "classCode": "{{classCode}}",
  "netWeightQuantity": {{tiny}}, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "{{unit}}" } ] }

### 22 Replace MRN-C's reservation with more than is available
# Answers: does a refused replacement keep the old hold, or end it?
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnC}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": {{line}}, "classCode": "{{classCode}}",
  "netWeightQuantity": 99999999, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "{{unit}}" } ] }

### 23 Ledger after the refused replacement
GET {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/quantities
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 24 Reserve 1 g against the kilogram line, MRN-D
# Answers: are grams accepted, and which unit does the allocation report?
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnD}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": {{line}}, "classCode": "{{classCode}}",
  "netWeightQuantity": 1, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "GRM" } ] }

### 25 Ledger after the grams reservation
GET {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/quantities
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 26 Replace MRN-D's hold with 0.000002 t (2 g)
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnD}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": {{line}}, "classCode": "{{classCode}}",
  "netWeightQuantity": 0.000002, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "TNE" } ] }

### 27 Delete MRN-D's reservation
DELETE {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedId}}/declarations/{{mrnD}}/reservation
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 28 Read the CHED-A
# Answers: is the line in H87? A rerun copies its line number and code into steps 29-33.
GET {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedA}}/quantities
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 29 Reserve 1 piece against the CHED-A, MRN-E
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedA}}/declarations/{{mrnE}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": 1, "classCode": "0102",
  "netVolumeQuantity": 1, "netVolumeUnitOfMeasure": "H87" } ] }

### 30 Replace MRN-E's hold with 1 kg
# Answers: is mixing mass and pieces refused, and with which reason?
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedA}}/declarations/{{mrnE}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": 1, "classCode": "0102",
  "netWeightQuantity": 1, "netWeightUnitOfMeasure": "KGM" } ] }

### 31 Read the CHED-A
# Answers: did the refusal end MRN-E's hold?
GET {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedA}}/quantities
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 32 Replace MRN-E's hold with the wrong commodity code
# Answers: does a refusal on a check (03) end the hold, as 05 did in step 22?
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedA}}/declarations/{{mrnE}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": 1, "classCode": "99999999",
  "netVolumeQuantity": 1, "netVolumeUnitOfMeasure": "H87" } ] }

### 33 Replace MRN-E's hold against an unknown line
PUT {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedA}}/declarations/{{mrnE}}/reservation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{ "items": [ { "goodsItemNumber": 1, "certificateLineNumber": 999, "classCode": "0102",
  "netVolumeQuantity": 1, "netVolumeUnitOfMeasure": "H87" } ] }

### 34 Delete MRN-E's reservation
DELETE {{host}}/customs/cheds/{{chedA}}/declarations/{{mrnE}}/reservation
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}
